      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__eyebrow">The honest read</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__heading">Why do teams leave Qualtrics?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__sub">Most teams that leave say a version of the same thing: the platform demands more time, training, and budget than their surveys ever needed.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__grid">

      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="1"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__title">Pricing you cannot see until sales calls back</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__body">Qualtrics does not publish prices. Every quote is scoped by product, seats, and volume, which makes budgeting a guessing game and comparison shopping nearly impossible.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__title">Slow from decision to first response</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__body">Between the demo, the scoping calls, and the contract, weeks can pass before anyone sends a survey. Teams that need answers this week feel every one of those days.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__title">Small teams pay for depth they never touch</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__body">The suite bundles modules many teams never open, and unlocking real value often means bringing in consultants. On a small team, that math stops working fast.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"/><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"/><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__title">Too much complexity for simple surveys</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-leave__body">Getting a basic survey out can take days of learning first. The XM platform is a lot of machine when all you need is a clean questionnaire.</p></article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

