<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__container">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__eyebrow">Pricing compared</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__heading">Formester vs Qualtrics pricing: what do you actually pay?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__sub">Formester's tiers next to how Qualtrics sells. No interpretation needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__grid">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__card fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__card--formester">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tag">Our pick</span>
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://formester.com&amp;size=64" alt="Formester logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Formester</span></h3>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tiers">
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier">
          <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head">
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Free</span>
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">$0/mo</span>
          </div>
          <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">Unlimited forms, unlimited responses, AI form creator, all field types, quiz auto-scoring, drop-off analysis, custom email notifications, payment collection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier">
          <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head">
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Personal</span>
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">$13/mo</span>
          </div>
          <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Free, plus remove branding, conditional logic + rules, redirect on completion, backend-only forms, GTM + GA4, SEO meta tags, email verification, custom scripts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier">
          <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head">
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Business</span>
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">$49/mo</span>
          </div>
          <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Personal, plus API access, PDF exports, 25 team members, real-time collaboration, 50 GB file storage, address autocomplete, partial submissions, form translations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier">
          <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head">
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span>
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">Let's Talk</span>
          </div>
          <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Business, plus custom limits, custom form building, unlimited webhooks, high-volume file uploads, unlimited signatures, unlimited team members, priority support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
        <a href="https://app.formester.com/users/sign_up" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__cta">Sign Up Free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__card">
      
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://www.qualtrics.com&amp;size=64" alt="Qualtrics logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Qualtrics</span></h3>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Free account</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">$0</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">3 active surveys, 30 questions per survey, 500 responses, 8 question types. Skip, display, and branch logic included. No expiration.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-name">Paid plans</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-cost">Custom quote</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__tier-body">No public tiers. Sales scopes each quote by product line, seat count, and response volume. Reviewers commonly report annual contracts starting in the low four figures per user; treat any number as directional and confirm with Qualtrics sales.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__callout">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__callout-ic" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.98.65-1.74 1.41-2.5A4.65 4.65 0 0 0 18 8 6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .23 2.23 1.5 3.5A4.61 4.61 0 0 1 8.91 14"/></svg>
      </span>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-pricing__callout-text"><strong>Worth flagging:</strong> Qualtrics publishes no tiers, so every figure comes from a quote scoped by product line, seat count, and response volume. Treat any number you read elsewhere as directional and confirm it with their sales team.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
