<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp-title"><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__container"><header class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__header"><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__eyebrow">For developers</span></p><h2 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__title" id="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp-title">Can AI agents read your survey data?</h2><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__intro">Every Formester survey ships with a REST API and an MCP server. Submissions don't stop at a CSV. The Qualtrics alternative built for teams running AI agents on top of their data.</p></header><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__grid"><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M8 7l3 9M16 7l-3 9"></path></svg></span><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__badge">MCP server</span></p><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__card-title">Plug Formester into Claude, ChatGPT, or any MCP-compatible model</h3><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chips"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">Claude</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">ChatGPT</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">Custom agents</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__body">Connect Formester to any MCP-compatible model and let it read your form submissions directly. Ask Claude "which leads from this week's form look highest fit?", or have a custom agent score job applications against the role brief and flag the top candidates for the recruiter.</p><p><a class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.formester.com/formester-mcp-server.html">Read the MCP docs →</a></p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline><line x1="13" y1="4" x2="11" y2="20"></line></svg></span><p><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__badge fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__badge--alt">REST API v2</span></p><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__card-title">Or build directly on the REST API</h3><div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chips"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">Self-service token</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">Webhooks</span> <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__chip">Business plan +</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__body">Pull form submissions into your data warehouse, push pre-filled form URLs back from your CRM, or build a custom enrichment pipeline. Self-service token at app.formester.com/api in two clicks. No support ticket, no waiting.</p><p><a class="fmstr-cmp-qua-api-mcp__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.formester.com/formester-api.html">Read the API docs →</a></p></article></div></div></section>
      </div>
    </section>

