<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__eyebrow">Why teams switch</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__heading">Why do teams choose Formester over Qualtrics?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__sub">Five differences that decide it for teams leaving enterprise survey platforms.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__grid">

      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l1.9 5.6L19 10l-5.1 1.4L12 17l-1.9-5.6L5 10l5.1-1.4L12 3z"/><path d="M19 3l.7 2.1L22 6l-2.3.9L19 9l-.7-2.1L16 6l2.3-.9L19 3z"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__title">AI form generator on the free plan</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__body">Describe the survey and it exists. Qualtrics assists with suggestions and analysis; it does not draft a working form from a prompt.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="1"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__title">Prices on a public page</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__body">Free is $0. Personal is $13 a month, Business is $49. You can budget the whole decision before talking to anyone.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__title">Native payments included on the free plan</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__body">Qualtrics has no native payment field. Here Stripe and PayPal are built in, on the free plan.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__title">MCP server for AI agents</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__body">Connect Claude, ChatGPT, or your own agent straight to submissions. Formester ships an MCP server on Business, something almost no form or survey vendor offers today.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__title">No training course before your first form</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-why-pick__body">Sign up, generate, publish. The editor works the way you expect on the first try, which is the point of leaving an enterprise suite.</p></article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-component-item">
      <div class="raw-html-content">
<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__eyebrow">Migration</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__heading">How do you switch from Qualtrics to Formester?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__sub">Three steps. The real question is not whether Formester can take over your forms, it is how much of an afternoon the move will eat.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__grid">

      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__step">
        <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__title">Take copies of everything first</h3>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__body">In Qualtrics, open Data &amp; Analysis, then Export &amp; Import, and download each survey's responses as a CSV. Grab the survey structure as a QSF file while you are there. Your Qualtrics account keeps running; you are only taking copies.</p>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__hint"><strong>Time:</strong> 5 to 10 minutes for a typical 5-form workspace.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__step">
        <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__title">Let the AI rebuild the form</h3>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__body">Paste your question list into Formester's AI generator, or upload the survey as a PDF. It drafts the fields, types, and logic in about half a minute; you fix the wording and add your branding.</p>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__hint"><strong>Time:</strong> 10 to 20 minutes per form for a typical 10-field form.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__step">
        <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__title">Re-point integrations, keep a safety net</h3>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__body">Move your Slack, Zapier, or native connections over and send one test submission. Keep the Qualtrics survey live for a week as a fallback, then retire it once the numbers match.</p>
        <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-switch__hint"><strong>Time:</strong> 10 to 15 minutes; keep Qualtrics active for a week as a fallback.</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

