<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__eyebrow">Honest comparison</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__heading">When is Qualtrics still the better choice?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__sub">Formester is not the answer for every team. Two cases where staying put is the right call.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__grid">

      <article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__cicon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__title">You need certified enterprise research depth</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__desc">The certification stack regulated buyers ask for, plus research tooling a form builder does not attempt.</p><ul class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__list"><li>SOC 2, ISO 27001, HIPAA capability, and FedRAMP authorization</li><li>Panel management, advanced sampling, and StatsIQ analysis</li><li>Formester holds GDPR, UK GDPR, and CCPA, and is not SOC 2 or ISO 27001 certified</li><li>Compensating controls in place: encryption in transit and at rest, annual third-party penetration testing, enforced 2FA, and encrypted backups</li></ul><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__tradeoff">Choose Qualtrics for IRB-style research and compliance-gated procurement</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__cicon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__title">Your organisation already runs on the XM platform</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__desc">One vendor, one data model, one security review.</p><ul class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__list"><li>New surveys inherit existing dashboards, workflows, and admin</li><li>Billing and access controls are already in place</li><li>Formester runs standalone, with its own billing and integrations</li></ul><p class="fmstr-cmp-qua-when-wins__tradeoff">Choose Qualtrics if the XM platform is already your system of record</p></article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-component-item">
      <div class="raw-html-content">
<section class="fmstr-cmp-qua-privacy" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-qua-privacy-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-privacy__container">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-qua-privacy__inner">
